00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:17.780
GMTea


00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:18.040
GMTeam


00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:18.300
GMTeam m


00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:18.560
GMTeam mo


00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:18.820
GMTeam mov


00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:19.080
GMTeam movi


00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:19.470
